                  "text": "Luka 21:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mutu andafyakatsira nduguye aolagbwe, baba andamfyakatsira mwanawe, nao ana andaagalukira avyazi aho aafyakatsire ili aolagbwe. ",
          "type": "text",
